      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MCCRACKEN (5) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was too tough when scoring last time over 342m at this track in a Grade 6 (19.34). Form at the trip excellent including two wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Looks the one to beat. DIVINE CRYSTAL (4) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in five starts, including two wins and three placings. Hit the frame latest (22.75) when second at Murray Bridge in a Grade 6. Can feature in the finish. MYSTIC GAZE (1) had been racing well with a Grade 6 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Can improve sharply here. POCO SIYAN (2) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at Gawler (23.47) in a Grade 6, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
